# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003053> (ventricular zone)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ZFA:0001083") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003053> "Proliferative region that is part of the ventricular system.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "http://www.dartmouth.edu/~rswenson/NeuroSci/chapter_4.html") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003053> "Proliferative zone in the region of the neural tube adjacent to the lumen.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "BTO:0003654") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0003053> "There are two primary regions that are thought to give rise to neurons that make up the cerebellum. The first region is the ventricular zone (the roof of the fourth ventricle). This area produces Purkinje cells and deep cerebellar nuclear neurons[BTO:0003654].")
